      <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl text-xl leading-9 text-[#4a2d17]">Head-to-head for abandoned cart recovery: timing, channel mix, margin-safe incentives, and Shopify checkout context. Pair test AOVs: $594 and $247.</p>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <TldrBox picks={[{ label: 'Pick A', tool: a.name, reason: a.tagline }, { label: 'Pick B', tool: b.name, reason: b.tagline }, { label: 'Lifecycle layer', tool: 'Sequenzy', reason: 'Strategy and suppression orchestration first.' }]} />
